nt resting pad whose actual effects can be tested against ordinary rest. Preserve uncertainty about health, warmth and comfort until measured. If unsupported, explain the missing mechanics without claiming construction or benefits.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The moss trial established only the reported response at load 0.3; it did not establish suitability for bedding.\\\",\\\"Evaluate the returned specification before learning or constructing anything. No benefit is attributed to requesting an interface.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Prefer recoverable small trials and reusable practical abilities over repeated material tests without a decision purpose.\\\",\\\"Maintain food and energy reserves before discretionary work.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"moss-material-trial\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"What does a small mechanical trial establish about local moss as a potential bedding material?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"At tick 38, pressing an owned moss sample at intensity 0.3 consumed 0.1 moss and returned load=0.3, held=false, flexibility=0.8 (event-38-sol-188).\\\",\\\"The owned sample has 0.9 moss remaining.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"The result is limited to this load condition. Insulation, cleanliness, bedding feasibility and comfort effects remain unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Obtain a bounded material observation before considering bedding construction.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Gathered an owned moss sample.\\\",\\\"Performed one small press trial using its exact item identity.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Verified moss load-response observation at load-band-0.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"No further evidence is needed for the bounded mechanical-observation goal.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Use the limited result to assess whether a separate practical bedding trial is supported.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"